      "id": "t2",
      "x": 62,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 1560,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "The decision: WHERE should the \"consumed needs an amount\" check (#677) live?  -  that choice is what makes resume safe or not.\nData is SAFE on disk (in-kind Rs.555 preserved) - it is the resume REPLAY that breaks, not the stored data.",
