    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "crux_t",
      "x": 78,
      "y": 282,
      "width": 1550,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "THE CRUX:  CSPro logic can't tell \"genuinely empty amount\" (normal entry - SHOULD trip #677) from \"transiently notappl\" (resume replay -\nshould be LEFT ALONE).  Both read as notappl.  Every option below is really a different answer to this one problem.",
      "originalText": "THE CRUX:  CSPro logic can't tell \"genuinely empty amount\" (normal entry - SHOULD trip #677) from \"transiently notappl\" (resume replay -\nshould be LEFT ALONE).  Both read as notappl.  Every option below is really a different answer to this one problem.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#b45309",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
