    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "rec_t",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1092,
      "width": 1545,
      "height": 53,
      "text": "RECOMMENDATION  ->  Option A.   It removes the exact per-row pre-fill + reenter that the resume replay trips on (the root cause), keeps the\ndata-quality check by relocating it to one soft section-end gate, and applies uniformly to all 7 rosters.   B leaves a real data-loss risk;\nC is strongest but bets on a resume signal CSPro doesn't cleanly expose - I'd only reach for C if A's section-end check proves too weak on device.",
      "originalText": "RECOMMENDATION  ->  Option A.   It removes the exact per-row pre-fill + reenter that the resume replay trips on (the root cause), keeps the\ndata-quality check by relocating it to one soft section-end gate, and applies uniformly to all 7 rosters.   B leaves a real data-loss risk;\nC is strongest but bets on a resume signal CSPro doesn't cleanly expose - I'd only reach for C if A's section-end check proves too weak on device.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#047857",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
